    {
      "name": "Recorded pneumonia on or after an eligible stroke admission in the same observation period",
      "description": "Use with the bundled general stroke target definition in Cohort2Trajectory. The stroke visit uses the original acute-visit, I63 source-code and 1095-day prior-observation criteria. Pneumonia is dated by its condition record. No dysphagia, time-limit or death-cause-status filter is applied.",
      "expression": {
        "Type": "ALL",
        "CriteriaList": [
